#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:5
#: 8e86eacc6ff1484198063a4b4d8300cb
msgid "Using last_letter as an External SITL Simulator"
msgstr "将 last_letter 用作外部 SITL 仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:7
#: 8358e8d292ec464d901e78522071e8c8
msgid ""
"This article explains how to run :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>` for Plane using `last_letter "
"<https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter>`__ as the flight simulation engine"
" (instead of *JSBSim*)."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 `last_letter <https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter>`__ "
"作为飞行仿真引擎（代替 *JSBSim*）来运行 Plane 的 :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:14
#: ec375ea884b646f1aca1111c902a2f77
msgid ""
"Currently the *last_letter* simulator is in early development stage and also"
" only supports fixed-wing aircraft. Expect frequent updates and changes in "
"its architecture. Up-to-date documentation on *last_letter* is always found "
"at its Github page."
msgstr ""
"目前 *last_letter* 仿真器处于早期开发阶段，且仅支持固定翼飞机。预计其架构会频繁更新和变更。*last_letter* "
"的最新文档始终可在其 Github 页面上找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:23
#: 7d79619eff974833934bc974632de2a4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:25
#: 732566d6ca484bd2be3e053a99fa141d
msgid ""
"Currently, the default simulation software for Plane SITL is `JSBSim "
"<http://jsbsim.sourceforge.net/>`__. While this is a renowned simulation "
"solution for fixed-wing aircraft, it is primarily targeted towards full-"
"scale vehicles and focuses on relevant features such as fuel management, "
"variable pitch drives and oleos. After many years of life it is difficult to"
" modify to cater for UAV-specific applications. Moreover it is paired with "
"`FlightGear <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ as the visualizer, which is a "
"quite a demanding piece of software in terms of system resources."
msgstr ""
"目前，Plane SITL 的默认仿真软件是 `JSBSim "
"<http://jsbsim.sourceforge.net/>`__。虽然这是固定翼飞机领域知名的仿真解决方案，但它主要面向全尺寸飞行器，专注于燃油管理、变距螺旋桨和起落架减震器等相关功能。经过多年的发展，要针对"
" UAV 特定应用进行修改已十分困难。此外，它与 `FlightGear <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ "
"配套作为可视化工具，该软件对系统资源要求相当高。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:35
#: 989807ff7b2b4ba09712c155b9257d79
msgid ""
"In contrast, during the development of a robotic platform it is often more "
"important to have easy access to the system states, be able to change "
"simulator components easily, add new subsystems, and interface with other "
"packages."
msgstr "相比之下，在机器人平台的开发过程中，能够轻松访问系统状态、方便地更换仿真器组件、添加新子系统并与其他软件包接口往往更为重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:40
#: 20a3dbf921e449fba10cab80c4244430
msgid ""
"The `Robotics Operating System <http://www.ros.org/>`__ (ROS) framework is a"
" potential answer to this need. It is a software framework which resides on "
"top of the operating system, orchestrating the execution of multiple "
"programs and the communication between them. It provides the tools to "
"compile programs written in C++ and Python and monitor their execution. It "
"is specifically targeted for development of modular robotics applications by"
" providing standardized message headers, universally useful system tools, "
"logging capabilities, execution across multiple machines and most "
"importantly a large codebase of user-submitted, stand-alone packages, fit "
"for diverse applications."
msgstr ""
"`机器人操作系统 "
"<http://www.ros.org/>`__（ROS）框架是解决这一需求的潜在方案。它是一个运行于操作系统之上的软件框架，负责协调多个程序的执行及其相互通信。它提供了编译"
" C++ 和 Python "
"程序并监控其运行的工具，专门针对模块化机器人应用的开发，提供标准化消息头、通用系统工具、日志记录能力、跨多机执行，以及最重要的——大量用户提交的独立软件包代码库，适用于各种应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:51
#: c95aeb79b9ec4d87897cbeb584edb578
msgid ""
"*last_letter* is a flight simulator written mostly in C++ under the ROS "
"framework. It incorporates a modular description of the airplane model, "
"modeling aerodynamics, propeller and motor dynamics, ground reactions, wind "
"and gust disturbances and much more. Its structure allows for relatively "
"easy coding of additional functions, and offers the potential for a unified "
"simulator for all platforms, compatibility with other ROS packages and a "
"modular, detailed simulation solution."
msgstr ""
"*last_letter* 是一个在 ROS 框架下主要用 C++ "
"编写的飞行仿真器。它包含对飞机模型的模块化描述，对气动力学、螺旋桨和电机动力学、地面反应、风和阵风扰动等进行建模。其结构允许相对容易地编写附加功能，并提供了统一仿真所有平台、与其他"
" ROS 软件包兼容以及模块化详细仿真解决方案的潜力。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:60
#: 6a4730e6d731453d83c0e4df6978aedf
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:63
#: 2e137ec0801c4f27b4b1c925275f6635
msgid "ROS version"
msgstr "ROS 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:65
#: 87e39fd6e0ff418fa8cffa681c33d951
msgid ""
"*Last_letter* is being developed under *ROS Indigo*, and this is the only "
"supported version."
msgstr "*Last_letter* 在 *ROS Indigo* 下开发，这是唯一受支持的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:70
#: 41179f03fa0a4ff48d001d5ed6dc4e20
msgid ""
"*Last_letter* was originally developed under ROS Hydro, and no code changes "
"were required during the transition. While ROS Hydro is no longer supported,"
" developers that need to use *last_letter* on this version may find it still"
" works."
msgstr ""
"*Last_letter* 最初在 ROS Hydro 下开发，迁移过程中无需更改代码。虽然 ROS Hydro 已不再受支持，但需要在该版本上使用 "
"*last_letter* 的开发者可能会发现它仍然可以工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:76
#: 763b81de20114d49879765d7f5906bf8
msgid "Operating System requirements"
msgstr "操作系统要求"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:78
#: ef1ad64c60d64520af9f14130a138c4c
msgid ""
"The selected operating system must be `compatible with ROS Indigo "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/indigo/Installation>`__ in order to run *last_letter*."
msgstr ""
"所选操作系统必须 `与 ROS Indigo 兼容 <http://wiki.ros.org/indigo/Installation>`__ 才能运行 "
"*last_letter*。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:81
#: 7b5ec5048151478e814dac34c7a244e2
msgid ""
"We recommend Ubuntu 14.04.2 as this is the platform used for developing "
"*last_letter* and is also known to be compatible with SITL. Ubuntu Linux "
"13.10 and 14.04 are also supported by both *ROS Indigo* and SITL."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 Ubuntu 14.04.2，因为这是开发 *last_letter* 所使用的平台，也已知与 SITL 兼容。Ubuntu Linux "
"13.10 和 14.04 也同时受 *ROS Indigo* 和 SITL 的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:86
#: 1685d9ebf30348e48cda40c996144626
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:88
#: ddfeeb7aaad340f195f12947d4c48613
msgid ""
"First install the Plane SITL on your Linux machine, as described "
":ref:`Setting up SITL on Linux <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>`."
msgstr ""
"首先在您的 Linux 机器上安装 Plane SITL，如 :ref:`在 Linux 上设置 SITL <setting-up-sitl-on-"
"linux>` 所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:91
#: c5a9b39195b44f54bf6fa204e18b556c
msgid ""
"Like any other set of ROS packages, *last_letter* and its companion library "
"packages **last_letter_msgs**, **uav_utils**, **math_utils** and "
"**rqt_dashboard** require ROS to be present on your system. If you have "
"previous experience with ROS and have it on your system, installation of\\ "
"*last_letter* is as simple as cloning the package files in your workspace. "
"If not, the following instructions will guide you through the process."
msgstr ""
"与任何其他 ROS 软件包集合一样，*last_letter* 及其配套库软件包 "
"**last_letter_msgs**、**uav_utils**、**math_utils** 和 **rqt_dashboard** "
"需要系统中已安装 ROS。如果您有使用 ROS 的经验并已安装，安装 *last_letter* "
"只需将软件包文件克隆到您的工作空间即可。否则，请按照以下说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:100
#: efbfe4b9abe74e8691dcfa7ed55a6a5b
msgid "ROS installation"
msgstr "ROS 安装"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:102
#: 49f3b3b393da4fd9ac99dee8a58e01eb
msgid ""
"Follow the `instructions on the ROS website "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/indigo/Installation/Ubuntu>`__ to install *ROS Indigo* "
"in your machine."
msgstr ""
"按照 `ROS 网站上的说明 <http://wiki.ros.org/indigo/Installation/Ubuntu>`__ 在您的机器上安装 "
"*ROS Indigo*。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:106
#: 76ea12cbbfce457391ab8f7dc641efd5
msgid "Workspace creation"
msgstr "创建工作空间"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:108
#: e8c229184fe141c3a62811482428e105
msgid ""
"After installing ROS you need to create a ROS Workspace. This is the "
"directory where custom software packages (packages which are not part of the"
" official ROS repository) are created, copied or edited. This is also where "
"the ROS compiler (also known as *catkin*) looks for your code."
msgstr ""
"安装 ROS 后，您需要创建一个 ROS 工作空间。这是创建、复制或编辑自定义软件包（不属于官方 ROS 仓库的软件包）的目录。这也是 ROS "
"编译器（也称为 *catkin*）查找您代码的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:113
#: bc85c465c4334a22bc6682b506c4b1a5
msgid ""
"Follow these `instructions to create your workspace "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials/InstallingandConfiguringROSEnvironment#Create_a_ROS_Workspace>`__."
" They instruct you to create your workspace under your home folder, but it "
"can also be created elsewhere. Just be sure you have full rights to this "
"folder, so a subfolder in your home folder is a good choice. Make sure "
"``$ROS_PACKAGE_PATH`` sees your **catkin_ws/src** folder."
msgstr ""
"按照这些 `创建工作空间的说明 "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials/InstallingandConfiguringROSEnvironment#Create_a_ROS_Workspace>`__。说明建议在主文件夹下创建工作空间，也可在其他位置创建。只需确保您对该文件夹拥有完全权限，因此主文件夹的子文件夹是个好选择。确保"
" ``$ROS_PACKAGE_PATH`` 能找到您的 **catkin_ws/src** 文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:121
#: 34adbb22689f473b958e9e3779a7ab82
msgid ""
"You probably don't want to source your workspace path every time you open a "
"new console. To avoid this, add the following line to your "
"**/home/<username>/.bashrc** file (assuming that you created your catkin "
"workspace directly under your home folder)."
msgstr ""
"您可能不希望每次打开新控制台时都要手动加载工作空间路径。为避免这种情况，请将以下行添加到您的 **/home/<username>/.bashrc** "
"文件中（假设您直接在主文件夹下创建了 catkin 工作空间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:131
#: 8cc37a1f414e4aca81921128fc0f36d1
msgid "Cloning the last_letter simulator files"
msgstr "克隆 last_letter 仿真器文件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:133
#: d4ddfab12b71489dae6d0a06b58b95a1
msgid ""
"Execute the following commands in your console to download and compile the "
"simulator (without the comments):"
msgstr "在控制台中执行以下命令以下载和编译仿真器（忽略注释）："

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:145
#: adb9a6837c7341c08533015205f5b1b0
msgid "Compilation may take a while."
msgstr "编译可能需要一段时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:148
#: 7a73a1dcffc74548b4489a410aa6d3a6
