msgstr "测试所有内容是否已正确安装"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:150
#: 5d74513fc610496eb6b5519f0b2a744b
msgid "In a console, run:"
msgstr "在控制台中运行："

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:156
#: 20ce1197766c456e890a0925781981b8
msgid ""
"This should start the simulator and open a 3D simulation environment using "
"an application called *RViz*. The *rqt_gui* application will start as well; "
"this is where the avionics instruments are displayed."
msgstr "这将启动仿真器并使用名为 *RViz* 的应用打开 3D 仿真环境。*rqt_gui* 应用也将同时启动；这是显示航电仪表的地方。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:160
#: 453af7a3c6214b098b7a5f2795cf9adb
msgid ""
"If everything went smoothly, you can close everything and proceed to "
"interface *last_letter* with Plane SITL."
msgstr "如果一切顺利，您可以关闭所有内容，然后继续将 *last_letter* 与 Plane SITL 对接。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:164
#: add75eb26a6f45479f9fec5a9cacf63b
msgid "Using last_letter as the physics simulator for SITL"
msgstr "将 last_letter 用作 SITL 的物理仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:166
#: c35bb9d9ced84995aef87eca1e8120fc
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`Plane SITL instructions <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` to "
"download and compile the Plane code. Make sure your local git branch is "
"checked out on ``master``."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`Plane SITL 说明 <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` 下载并编译 Plane 代码。确保您的本地 git"
" 分支已切换到 ``master``。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:170
#: 1e2795fa05204164ad70941f42bb8f4c
msgid ""
"When everything is done, enter the Plane directory and start the SITL "
"simulation:"
msgstr "完成后，进入 Plane 目录并启动 SITL 仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:178
#: e1f4d0dd78d84505b1bf17de92ef93e9
msgid ""
"This will run SITL, Plane, MAVProxy and *last_letter* along with *RViz* all "
"in one go (the *RViz* visualizer may take several seconds to start). This "
"procedure will automatically invoke the *last_letter* launch file and set "
"the ``Plane`` parameter to ``true`` so that the communication nodes between "
"*last_letter* and Plane are raised. If *last_letter* communicates with Plane"
" correctly, the MAVProxy console should display 3D satellite fix and track "
"10 satellites."
msgstr ""
"这将一次性运行 SITL、Plane、MAVProxy 和 *last_letter* 以及 *RViz*（*RViz* "
"可视化器可能需要几秒钟才能启动）。此过程将自动调用 *last_letter* 启动文件，并将 ``Plane`` 参数设置为 "
"``true``，以便建立 *last_letter* 和 Plane 之间的通信节点。如果 *last_letter* 与 Plane "
"通信正常，MAVProxy 控制台应显示 3D 卫星定位并追踪 10 颗卫星。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:186
#: 1fa5d35b0bbc4e14b67c8ff08c1b81ff
msgid ""
"When you start sim_vehicle.py an xterm will be created which launches "
"ArduPilot and last_letter. If you have troubles running the simulator then "
"finding this (minimised) xterm and looking at the debug output there can be "
"very helpful."
msgstr ""
"启动 sim_vehicle.py 时，将创建一个 xterm 窗口用于启动 ArduPilot 和 "
"last_letter。如果运行仿真器遇到问题，找到这个（最小化的）xterm 并查看其中的调试输出会很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:191
#: 1f14c9b212af42a7b53321510d86c633
msgid "You can issue commands or RC overrides using MAVProxy as normal."
msgstr "您可以像往常一样使用 MAVProxy 发出命令或遥控覆盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:194
#: 76c25ddd82fa461d84d5adbcaf796222
msgid "Missing features"
msgstr "缺失功能"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:196
#: a80c170443c246dcb13ce012d0445e78
msgid ""
"At time of writing (17 March, 2015), *last_letter* does not support the "
"common initialization arguments (such as starting location). Moreover, the "
"MAVProxy commands which would control the JSBSim simulator (such as the wind"
" and pause commands) are not supported."
msgstr ""
"在撰写本文时（2015 年 3 月 17 日），*last_letter* 不支持常见的初始化参数（如起始位置）。此外，用于控制 JSBSim 仿真器的"
" MAVProxy 命令（如风和暂停命令）也不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:201
#: 21ee1c78b1d1453baf7cbc8a2ee56161
msgid ""
"Currently, the only way to select the aircraft and alter its initial states "
"is by editing the parameter files of the simulator, as described in `the "
"corresponding manual page "
"<https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter/blob/master/last_letter/doc/manual/parameterFiles.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"目前，选择飞机和修改其初始状态的唯一方法是编辑仿真器的参数文件，如 `相应手册页 "
"<https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter/blob/master/last_letter/doc/manual/parameterFiles.md>`__"
" 所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:206
#: f9cec357b3474783969c87581dd84fcb
msgid "Running last_letter in a virtual machine"
msgstr "在虚拟机中运行 last_letter"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:208
#: 3067ece2126f4430a747630d1391839e
msgid ""
"*Last_letter* has been successfully run within virtual machines using the "
"configurations described in its `compatibility information "
"<https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter/blob/master/last_letter/doc/manual/compatibility.md>`__."
" To test the performance of the simulator in a particular environment, look "
"at the xterm window assigned for the simulator output: There should be a "
"framerate message, updating every 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"*Last_letter* 已成功在虚拟机中使用其 `兼容性信息 "
"<https://github.com/Georacer/last_letter/blob/master/last_letter/doc/manual/compatibility.md>`__"
" 中描述的配置运行。要测试仿真器在特定环境中的性能，请查看分配给仿真器输出的 xterm 窗口：应有帧率消息每 5 秒更新一次。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-last_letter-as-an-external-sitl-simulator.rst:214
#: 18c99deb18ec4f199f6238c30f3fab50
msgid ""
"Currently, Plane and SITL are set to run at a nominal 500Hz. A frequency of "
"over 480Hz indicates that the simulator is running at an acceptable speed."
msgstr "目前，Plane 和 SITL 设置为以标称 500Hz 运行。频率超过 480Hz 表示仿真器以可接受的速度运行。"
